m/photo-1726616297855-d7cc1ec63f2a?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=jpg&amp;ixid=M3wzMDAzMzh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxiZWxseSUyMGRhbmNpbmd8ZW58MHx8fHwxNzkyMTQ3Njk1fDA&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;q=80&amp;w=1080 848w, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1726616297855-d7cc1ec63f2a?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=jpg&amp;ixid=M3wzMDAzMzh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxiZWxseSUyMGRhbmNpbmd8ZW58MHx8fHwxNzkyMTQ3Njk1fDA&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;q=80&amp;w=1080 1272w, https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1726616297855-d7cc1ec63f2a?crop=entropy&amp;cs=tinysrgb&amp;fit=max&amp;fm=jpg&amp;ixid=M3wzMDAzMzh8MHwxfHNlYXJjaHwxfHxiZWxseSUyMGRhbmNpbmd8ZW58MHx8fHwxNzkyMTQ3Njk1fDA&amp;ixlib=rb-4.1.0&amp;q=80&amp;w=1080 1456w" sizes="auto, 100vw" loading="lazy"></picture><div class="image-link-expand"><div class="pencraft pc-display-flex pc-gap-8 pc-reset"><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container restack-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg aria-hidden="true" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 20 20" fill="none" stroke-width="1.5" stroke="var(--color-fg-primary)" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="icon-noB79L"><g><path d="M2.53001 7.81595C3.49179 4.73911 6.43281 2.5 9.91173 2.5C13.1684 2.5 15.9537 4.46214 17.0852 7.23684L17.6179 8.67647M17.6179 8.67647L18.5002 4.26471M17.6179 8.67647L13.6473 6.91176M17.4995 12.1841C16.5378 15.2609 13.5967 17.5 10.1178 17.5C6.86118 17.5 4.07589 15.5379 2.94432 12.7632L2.41165 11.3235M2.41165 11.3235L1.5293 15.7353M2.41165 11.3235L6.38224 13.0882"></path></g></svg></button><button tabindex="0" type="button" class="pencraft pc-reset pencraft icon-container view-image buttonBase-GK1x3M"><svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="20" height="20" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" class="lucide lucide-maximize2 lucide-maximize-2 icon-noB79L"><polyline points="15 3 21 3 21 9"></polyline><polyline points="9 21 3 21 3 15"></polyline><line x1="21" x2="14" y1="3" y2="10"></line><line x1="3" x2="10" y1="21" y2="14"></line></svg></button></div></div></div></a><figcaption class="image-caption">Photo by <a href="https://unsplash.com/@valchion">Akshaya Jayaprakash</a> on <a href="https://unsplash.com">Unsplash</a></figcaption></figure></div><p><strong>Tu turno:</strong></p><p><strong>Peque&#241;o ejercicio de n&#250;meros altos</strong></p><p><strong>Si quieres ver los ejercicios relacionados con el post, &#161;suscr&#237;bete, es gratis!</strong></p><p>Enjoying these articles? Subscribe and receive new posts directly in your inbox so you never miss one. Subscriptions are free, and if you&#8217;d like to support my work, you can also become a paid subscriber.</p><p class="button-wrapper" data-attrs="{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://dailypushes.substack.com/subscribe?&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Subscribe now&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}" data-component-name="ButtonCreateButton"><a class="button primary" href="https://dailypushes.substack.com/subscribe?"><span>Subscribe now</span></a></p><p><strong>&#191;Qu&#233; tal te ha ido con los n&#250;meros? Cu&#233;ntanoslo en los comentarios: tus dudas y tus respuestas pueden ayudar a otros estudiantes.</strong></p><p class="button-wrapper" data-attrs="{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/spain-in-2-minutes-shakiras-concerts/comments&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Leave a comment&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}" data-component-name="ButtonCreateButton"><a class="button primary" href="https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/spain-in-2-minutes-shakiras-concerts/comments"><span>Leave a comment</span></a></p><p><strong>Curiosidades de esta gira europea</strong></p><p>La artista ha elegido Madrid como &#250;nica sede europea para estos 13 conciertos. Ha montado su propio estadio de f&#250;tbol, el &#8220;Estadio Shakira&#8221;, dentro de <strong>Macondo Park</strong>, una &#8220;ciudad&#8221; temporal en el sur de Madrid. All&#237; cre&#243; el pueblo de Macondo, el pueblo imaginario de Gabriel Garc&#237;a M&#225;rquez (1927-2014), basado en su gran novela, <em>Cien a&#241;os de soledad</em>. Hab&#237;a hasta un club de lectura con ese libro.</p><p>En Spanish Boutique somos muy fans de este libro, y de hecho es el favorito de Becario, as&#237; que yo creo que nos podr&#237;a preparar un art&#237;culo hablando un poco de &#233;l. Si tienes un nivel avanzado de espa&#241;ol, sin duda lo recomiendo; si no, quiz&#225; mejor esperar a m&#225;s adelante.</p><p>Y el salseo de c&#243;mo empez&#243; toda esta gira lo vamos a dejar de lado porque no quiero alargarlo m&#225;s, pero, &#161;pero, pero!</p><p>Para terminar, dos preguntitas:</p><ul><li><p>&#191;Has podido ir a alguno de los conciertos de Shakira? </p></li></ul><div class="poll-embed" data-attrs="{&quot;id&quot;:1513398}" data-component-name="PollToDOM"></div><p>If you enjoyed this article, I&#8217;d be incredibly grateful if you tapped the &#10084;&#65039; below and <strong>shared it with someone who might find it useful.</strong></p><p class="button-wrapper" data-attrs="{&quot;url&quot;:&quot;https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/spain-in-2-minutes-shakiras-concerts?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share&quot;,&quot;text&quot;:&quot;Share&quot;,&quot;action&quot;:null,&quot;class&quot;:null}" data-component-name="ButtonCreateButton"><a class="button primary" href="https://dailypushes.substack.com/p/spain-in-2-minutes-shakiras-concerts?utm_source=substack&utm_medium=email&utm_content=share&action=share"><span>Share</span></a></p><p>P.D. Si te interesa, puedes ver el concierto de Shakira completo en YouTube.</p><p>&#161;Hasta otro d&#237;a!</p><p>Myriam</p>]]></content:encoded></item>